    "details": "<p id=\"p-rc_9e299548ae2507b8-209\" data-path-to-node=\"1\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Escape Room</strong> is a technical challenge organized by CodeStorm (Fr. CRCE) testing coding, algorithmic problem-solving, debugging, and teamwork under time pressure</span><span data-path-to-node=\"1,2\">.</span></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\"><strong>Eligibility &amp; Team Guidelines</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"4\">\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_9e299548ae2507b8-210\" data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Team Size:</strong> 1-2 members</span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0,2\">.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_9e299548ae2507b8-211\" data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">CRCE Students:</strong> Both teammates must be from the same class</span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0,2\">.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_9e299548ae2507b8-212\" data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Non-CRCE Students:</strong> Both teammates must be from the same academic year</span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0,2\">.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_9e299548ae2507b8-213\" data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Cap:</strong> Maximum 2 teams allowed per class</span><span data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0,2\">.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong>Format &amp; Rounds</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Junior Track (FE / 11th / 12th / Diploma):</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1\">\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_9e299548ae2507b8-215\" data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Vibe Coding Challenge (45 mins):</strong> Single round</span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0,0,2\">. Build a functional, responsive web solution using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and permitted AI tools</span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0,0,4\">. Participants must bring their own laptops</span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0,0,6\">.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_9e299548ae2507b8-216\" data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Evaluation (20 Marks):</strong> Functionality (6), Ease of Access (4), Creativity (3), Design (3), Responsiveness (2), Originality (2)</span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,1,0,2\">.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Senior Track (SE / TE / BE):</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1\">\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_9e299548ae2507b8-217\" data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Round 1 &ndash; Technical Qualifier (45 mins):</strong> SE tackles 2 Debugging + 3 Problem-Solving questions; TE/BE tackles 5 Problem-Solving questions</span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0,0,2\">.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_9e299548ae2507b8-218\" data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Round 2 &ndash; DSA Escape Challenge (45 mins):</strong> Top 25% qualifying teams solve DSA challenges to uncover lock digits and crack the final escape mechanism</span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,1,0,2\">.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\"><strong>Rules &amp; Anti-Cheating</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_9e299548ae2507b8-219\" data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Tab-Switching:</strong> Monitored automatically during SE/TE/BE rounds</span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0,2\">.</span></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1\">\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_9e299548ae2507b8-220\" data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,0,0\">1st &amp; 2nd Tab Switch: Warnings</span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,0,0,2\">.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_9e299548ae2507b8-221\" data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,0,0\">3rd Tab Switch: Direct disqualification</span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,0,1,1,0,2\">.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_9e299548ae2507b8-222\" data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Integrity:</strong> Answer sharing, prohibited tools, or interference leads to immediate disqualification</span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0,2\">.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_9e299548ae2507b8-223\" data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Authority:</strong> The organizing committee&rsquo;s decisions are final</span><span data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0,2\">.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
